# Validate with: uvx --from cffconvert cffconvert --validate -i CITATION.cff
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file
  and include the acknowledgement: Funded by FIERCE through its Financial
  Support Programme (https://project-fierce.eu/).
type: software
title: "Deposium GeoAI"
abstract: >-
  Python MCP Server for Geospatial AI capabilities. Funded by FIERCE through
  its Financial Support Programme. FIERCE receives European Union funding
  under Horizon Europe, Grant Agreement 101177496.
repository-code: "https://github.com/theseedship/mcp_geoai_deposium"
authors:
  - given-names: Nicolas
    family-names: Geysse
    affiliation: "The Seed Ship"
  - given-names: Dickson
    family-names: Owuor
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-17"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mcp
  - geoai
  - geospatial
  - satellite
  - stac
  - change-detection
