  - type: data
    title: "Copernicus Sentinel-2 MSI Level-2A (Earth Search collection sentinel-2-l2a)"
    authors:
      - name: "European Space Agency (ESA), Copernicus programme"
    database-provider:
      name: "Element 84 (Earth Search)"
    url: "https://earth-search.aws.element84.com/v1/collections/sentinel-2-l2a"
    license-url: "https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice"
    notes: "Red (B04) and near-infrared (B08) bands read as COGs to derive NDVI (contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data). Processed by Sinergise and hosted on AWS Open Data. No DOI is given: Earth Search's cite-as DOI resolves to ESA's Collection-1 Level-1C page, and ESA's Collection-1 Level-2A DOI covers sentinel-2-c1-l2a, not the sentinel-2-l2a collection this software queries."
